37293>>>        //  Hide header & apply nice background style
37293>>>        Send HideHeader to ghoWebApp
37294>>>        WebSet psCSSClass of ghoWebApp to "LoginBackground"
37295>>>    End_Procedure
37296>>>    
37296>>>End_Object
